.TH WERKMEISTER-PR-ADOPT 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pr\-adopt \- Record a PR opened outside the workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pr adopt\fR [pr] [repo]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pr <reason>\fR
No PR — the fix is already on base
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the result as JSON
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
